  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.gems": "Gems",
  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.gems.gems": "Four gems are added to the world. Ruby, peridot, sapphire and topaz. Their ores drop the gem directly.",
  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.gems.gems.title": "Gems",
  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.gems.smelting": "A gem ore mined without Silk Touch already drops its gem. Smelt the ore itself when you have kept one whole.",
  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.gems.smelting.title": "From Ore",
  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.gems.storage": "Nine of a gem pack into a block, and the block breaks back down into nine. The same holds for every gem and metal here.",
  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.gems.storage.title": "Storage",
  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.metals": "Ores and Metals",
  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.metals.dusts": "Every metal here has a dust. The grinding mill from Assorted Machines turns an ore into two of them, and each one smelts back into an ingot.",
  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.metals.dusts.title": "Dusts",
  "manual.assortedcore.chapter.metals.gears": "Four ingots around a stick make a gear. Machines and the other Assorted mods can be built out of them.",
